From 79c08793a32aa33eb50f4137cb9fedd8a09d78bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Remora <remora@local>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 10:50:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 9003/9003] Remora: forward-port LineageOS legal info to AOSP
 17
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Upstream 'Settings: Add LineageOS legal info' does not apply: AOSP 17 gave
LegalPreference a fourth 'purpose' argument (so the hierarchy context differs)
and, more importantly, made 'purpose' an abstract member of PreferenceMetadata
— upstream's LineageLegalPreference predates that and would not compile.
Adds the override (reusing the title resource, as the sibling entries do).

NOTE: the preference hides itself unless ro.lineagelegal.url is set.
device/remora does not inherit vendor/lineage's common_mobile.mk where that
property lives, so its lineage.mk sets the property itself.

Change-Id: I62eab9a91cffed45501811c5c7beecce26ee25a5
---
 .../deviceinfo/legal/LegalSettingsScreen.kt   |  1 +
 .../legal/LineageLegalPreference.kt           | 61 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 62 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/legal/LineageLegalPreference.kt

diff --git a/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/legal/LegalSettingsScreen.kt b/src/com/android/settings/deviceinfo/legal/LegalSettingsScreen.kt
